    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rendang",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "rendang"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is not a curry in the usual sense. The coconut milk cooks down until it is entirely gone, leaving the beef coated in a deeply spiced, almost caramelised paste. It takes around 2.5 hours. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The dish needs attention in the final 30 minutes when the liquid is low. Stir frequently so the paste does not catch on the bottom of the pan."
          }
        ]
      },
